  "body": "\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><span style=\"font-family: Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">짇<ruby style=\"position: relative\">춘<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">슐<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˍ</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">싀<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ꞈ</rt></ruby> 짇<ruby style=\"position: relative\">춘<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">뤼<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˍ</rt></ruby></span></h2>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/BrNqAr7WcPc?version=3&amp;rel=1&amp;showsearch=0&amp;showinfo=1&amp;iv_load_policy=1&amp;fs=1&amp;hl=en&amp;autohide=2&amp;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span>\n</div></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">漢諺混寫 Hanri-Hangul mixed script</h3>\n\n\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">落葉<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">롷훃ˆ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">秋天<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">츄ˉ틸ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    loh-hiôh’e chiū-thḭ̂\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">滿滿<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">뫄ˆ뫄`</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">相思<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">슐ˉ싀ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    moâ-moà’e siṵ̄-sî\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">愛<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">애`-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">릐<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\" title=\"hît\">彼<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">힏ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">粒<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">럅-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">心<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">심ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative\">렣<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">想<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">슐ˉ</rt></ruby>’릐\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    ài-lì hît-liap-sîm lêh-siṵ̄’li\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">離別<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">리볟-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">時<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">시ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\" title=\"hît\">彼<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">힏ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">一日<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">짇띧ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    li-piet-sí hît-jit-rît\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">所<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">서ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">約束<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">역ˆ석</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">代誌<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">대지</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    sôr-yôrk-sork’e tai-ji\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">到底<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">ᄃᅷ`되`</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative\">릐<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative\">감<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">猶<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">얗ˆ-</rt></ruby>에<ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">記<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">기</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    tàu-toè lì kâm-yâh-e-ki\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">是<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">시-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">啥人<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">샬ˆ랑ˊ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">心虛<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">심ˉ희ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    si-siâ̰-láng’e sīm-hî\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">等<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">단ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">릐<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">幾<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">귀ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">落<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">롷-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">年<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">니ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    tân-lì kûi-loh-ní\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">看<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">콸`-</rt></ruby>뽀<ruby style=\"position: relative\">릐<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">日子<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">띧즤`</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">心<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">심ˆ</rt></ruby> 뾔<ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">開<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">퀴ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    khoà̰-bo-lì’e rit-jì sîm boe-khûi\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">踮<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">댬`-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\" title=\"jît\">這<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">짇ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">時<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">시ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\" title=\"jît\">這<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">짇ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">刻<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">켹</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    tiàm-jît-sí jît-khiek\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">最後<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">줴`ᄋᅷˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">才<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">쟣ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">來<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">래-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">覺醒<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">각ˆ칠`</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    juè-āu jiâh-lai-kâk-chḭ̀\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">墜落<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">뒤롷-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">愛情<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">애`졩ˊ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">深坑<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">침ˉ킬ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">撥<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">봫ˆ-</rt></ruby>뾔<ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">離<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">리ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    tui-loh-ài-jiéng’e chīm-khḭ̂ poâh-boe-lī\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">如今<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">뚜김ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">對<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">뒤`-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">릐<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">痴心<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">치ˉ심ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    ru-kîm tùi-lì’e chī-sîm\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">變成<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">볜솅-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">雲煙<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">훈옌ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">消失<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">ᄉᆤˉ싣</rt></ruby>’킈\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    pien-sieng-hun-yên siāu-sit’khi\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">可憐<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">코ˆ롄-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">愛情<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">애`졩ˊ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">花蕊<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">훼ˉ뤼`</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    khô-lien-ài-jiéng’e huē-lùi\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    뽀<ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">氣味<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">키`삐ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    bo-khì-bī\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">一吋<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">짇춘`-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">相思<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">슐ˉ싀ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">一吋<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">짇춘`-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">淚<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">뤼ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    jit-chùn-siṵ̄-sî jit-chùn-lūi\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">想欲<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">슐뼇ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">來<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">래-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">挽回<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">빤ˆ훼ˊ</rt></ruby> 뽀<ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">藥<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">욯-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">醫<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">이ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    siṵ-bêh-lai-bân-hué bo-yoh-î\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">哀怨<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">애ˉ완ˉ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">雨聲<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">허샬ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">吼<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">ᄒᅷˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">規暝<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">귀ˉ미ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    āi-oān’e hor-siâ̰ hâu-kūi-mí\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">心<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">심ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">稀微<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">히ˉ삐ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    sîm hī-bí\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">落葉<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">롷훃ˆ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">秋天<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">츄ˉ틸ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    loh-hiôh’e chiū-thḭ̂\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">滿滿<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">뫄ˆ뫄`</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">相思<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">슐ˉ싀ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    moâ-moà’e siṵ̄-sî\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">愛<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">애`-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">릐<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\" title=\"hît\">彼<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">힏ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">粒<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">럅-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">心<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">심ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative\">렣<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">想<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">슐ˉ</rt></ruby>’릐\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    ài-lì hît-liap-sîm lêh-siṵ̄’li\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">離別<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">리볟-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">時<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">시ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\" title=\"hît\">彼<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">힏ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">一日<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">짇띧ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    li-piet-sí hît-jit-rît\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">所<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">서ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">約束<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">역ˆ석</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">代誌<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">대지</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    sôr-yôrk-sork’e tai-ji\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">到底<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">ᄃᅷ`되`</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative\">릐<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative\">감<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">猶<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">얗ˆ-</rt></ruby>에<ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">記<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">기</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    tàu-toè lì kâm-yâh-e-ki\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">是<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">시-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">啥人<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">샬ˆ랑ˊ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">心虛<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">심ˉ희ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    si-siâ̰-láng’e sīm-hî\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">等<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">단ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">릐<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">幾<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">귀ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">落<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">롷-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">年<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">니ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    tân-lì kûi-loh-ní\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">看<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">콸`-</rt></ruby>뽀<ruby style=\"position: relative\">릐<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">日子<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">띧즤`</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">心<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">심ˆ</rt></ruby> 뾔<ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">開<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">퀴ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    khoà̰-bo-lì’e rit-jì sîm boe-khûi\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">踮<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">댬`-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\" title=\"jît\">這<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">짇ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">時<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">시ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\" title=\"jît\">這<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">짇ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">刻<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">켹</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    tiàm-jît-sí jît-khiek\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">最後<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">줴`ᄋᅷˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">才<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">쟣ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">來<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">래-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">覺醒<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">각ˆ칠`</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    juè-āu jiâh-lai-kâk-chḭ̀\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">墜落<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">뒤롷-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">愛情<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">애`졩ˊ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">深坑<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">침ˉ킬ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">撥<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">봫ˆ-</rt></ruby>뾔<ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">離<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">리ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    tui-loh-ài-jiéng’e chīm-khḭ̂ poâh-boe-lī\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">如今<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">뚜김ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">對<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">뒤`-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">릐<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">痴心<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">치ˉ심ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    ru-kîm tùi-lì’e chī-sîm\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">變成<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">볜솅-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">雲煙<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">훈옌ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">消失<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">ᄉᆤˉ싣</rt></ruby>’킈\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    pien-sieng-hun-yên siāu-sit’khi\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">可憐<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">코ˆ롄-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">愛情<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">애`졩ˊ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">花蕊<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">훼ˉ뤼`</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    khô-lien-ài-jiéng’e huē-lùi\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    뽀<ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">氣味<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">키`삐ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    bo-khì-bī\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">一吋<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">짇춘`-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">相思<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">슐ˉ싀ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">一吋<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">짇춘`-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">淚<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">뤼ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span sty